=\"bb_paragraph\" >The script contains about 80,000 words, equivalent to an abridged picture-book version of <i>Journey to the West</i>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is carefully crafted to recreate the events and characters from the original novel. The famous figures are reimagined as powerful bosses in the game\u2019s battles, offering players an immersive and exciting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003170/extras/b36eb611fc4544b2efc603d96aa0dff2.avif?t=1757437781\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Battle of Poker\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a Card-Based Battle system, where &quot;Cores&quot; serves as the player's HP. In addition to forming strategic card combinations to deal damage, players can also utilize special skills to outsmart their opponents and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003170/extras/97f4fa44c3038ab22cf1b0983a652e34.avif?t=1757437781\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Unique Skill\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has its own unique skill, unlocked gradually as you progress through the stages, with usage charges earned through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003170/extras/470aa67a3b4aaf60da4ee0a314258bfd.avif?t=1757437781\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Custom Deck\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the later part of the journey, players unlock deck customization. Expanding and refining the deck improves the probability of forming preferred combinations, allowing more strategic victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr